    <briefdescription>
<para>Handles STORAGE_COMPACTION by triggering a full RocksDB compaction. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Registered by the storage module at startup: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">orchestrator.registerTaskHandler(</highlight></codeline>
